  "name": "Towns - PWS, Copper River",
  "description": "Data Type: Infrastructure; This data layer contains the locations of towns within the Prince William Sound - Copper River basin ecosystem. Pacific GIS (Ecotrust and Conservation International) hand- digitized town locations from 1:63,360 scale USGS base maps. Annotations of town names are included.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Unknown",
